{
  "id": "literacy",
  "title": "导师学习与持续练习",
  "requirements": [
    "learning",
    "V3"
  ],
  "turns": [
    {
      "input": "我去小学堂找陆青。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_school"
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我问陆青能不能教我基础识字，以及一次学习需要多少费用和时间。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我交两枚铜币，跟陆青认真上一节基础识字课。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": -2
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.learning",
          "where": {
            "entity": "skill_literacy",
            "cost": 2
          },
          "min": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 60,
          "max": 80
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_learn"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "如果还没掌握基础识字，我愿再花两铜上一节；已经学会就练习认字一次。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "calls",
          "tool": "world_learn",
          "args": {},
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我继续跟着陆青练习。如果仍未学会就付两铜再试一次学习，不跳过费用。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "conditional",
          "when": {
            "path": "state.skills.skill_literacy"
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "kind": "calls",
              "tool": "world_practice",
              "args": {},
              "min": 1
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "kind": "calls",
              "tool": "world_learn",
              "args": {
                "entity": "skill_literacy"
              },
              "min": 1
            },
            {
              "kind": "delta",
              "path": "state.player.coins",
              "value": -2
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）我现在到底学会识字没有？只按已保存的结果回答。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "exists",
          "path": "state.skills.skill_literacy"
        },
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我向陆青道谢，留在学堂再练习一次，不另买东西。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我离开学堂走回村路。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "loc_hw"
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "initial": {
    "mode": "new"
  },
  "rubric": {
    "truth": "叙述与每回合工具和账本相符，失败不伪造成功",
    "agency": "不替玩家加购、接任务或作额外决定",
    "language": "简体中文，正文不泄漏编号、工具或提示词",
    "continuity": "记住本会话发生的交易、约定和人物处境"
  }
}
